{% comment %}
  LIFTD compliance block — NON-NEGOTIABLE.
  Rendered from layout/theme.liquid on every page. Not a section, not a
  customizer block: it must never be removable, editable, or reordered from
  the theme editor. Do not move it into a section group.

  This is the legal footer text from stayliftd.com, verbatim, so both
  surfaces read identically. Keep the state-law shipping qualifier and the
  approved facts only — no calories/onset changes here without a compliance
  decision (see CLAUDE.md).
{% endcomment %}
<aside class="liftd-compliance" aria-label="{{ 'compliance.aria_label' | t }}">
  <div class="liftd-wrapper">
    <p class="liftd-compliance__legal">
      *Shipping availability depends on your state&rsquo;s laws. 21+ only. Do not
      use if you are under 21 years of age. Keep cannabis out of the reach of
      children. Contains THC. Do not drive or operate machinery after use. Not
      for use during pregnancy or breastfeeding. Start low, go slow. This is not
      an inducement to purchase cannabis or cannabis products. Statements have
      not been evaluated by the FDA; this product is not intended to diagnose,
      treat, cure, or prevent any disease.
    </p>
    <p class="liftd-compliance__copy">
      &copy; {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ shop.name }}. All rights reserved.
      Manufactured by Dr. Ink CT
    </p>
  </div>
</aside>
